=== (1) Layer re-providing Region with the same payload ===
explain:
  all:audit.cd2/capability/v1: inherited path=["all:audit.cd2/capability/v1"]
  input:audit.cd2/input/region/v1: new cause={"kind":"input-provided","input":"audit.cd2/input/region/v1"} path=["input:audit.cd2/input/region/v1"]
  input:audit.cd2/input/tenant/v1: inherited path=["input:audit.cd2/input/tenant/v1"]
  service:audit.cd2.a@1.0.0: inherited path=["service:audit.cd2.a@1.0.0"]
  service:audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0: inherited path=["service:audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0"]
  service:audit.cd2/logger@1.0.0: inherited path=["service:audit.cd2/logger@1.0.0"]
  service:audit.cd2/panel@1.0.0: forked cause={"kind":"dependency-forked","via":"region","dependency":"input:audit.cd2/input/region/v1"} path=["service:audit.cd2/panel@1.0.0","input:audit.cd2/input/region/v1"]
  service:audit.cd2/pool@1.0.0: inherited path=["service:audit.cd2/pool@1.0.0"]
inspect:
  all:audit.cd2/capability/v1 -> site
  input:audit.cd2/input/region/v1 -> SELF
  input:audit.cd2/input/tenant/v1 -> site
  service:audit.cd2.a@1.0.0 -> site
  service:audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0 -> site
  service:audit.cd2/logger@1.0.0 -> app
  service:audit.cd2/panel@1.0.0 -> SELF
  service:audit.cd2/pool@1.0.0 -> app
spec K03/R16: explicit Input re-provision is a new slot even with the same payload; Panel depends on Region so Panel must fork; Cache does not depend on Region and must be inherited.

=== (2) share:[Cache] while the Entry re-provides Tenant (Cache depends on Tenant) ===
explain:
  NOT OK code=SHARE_CONSTRAINT_FAILED message=audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0 cannot reuse its parent-visible slot in Env check-5. details={"revision":"audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0","env":"check-5","cause":{"kind":"dependency-forked","via":"tenant","dependency":"input:audit.cd2/input/tenant/v1"},"path":["service:audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0","input:audit.cd2/input/tenant/v1"]}
enter: threw code=SHARE_CONSTRAINT_FAILED message=audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0 cannot reuse its parent-visible slot in Env env-6.
  details={"revision":"audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0","env":"env-6","cause":{"kind":"dependency-forked","via":"tenant","dependency":"input:audit.cd2/input/tenant/v1"},"path":["service:audit.cd2/cache@1.0.0","input:audit.cd2/input/tenant/v1"]}

